@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

actor Client as C1
actor SysAdmin as SA
actor FinancialAdvisor as FA
system System as S

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as VFD
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as RAT
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions Based on Historical Data and Trends" as FPT
  usecase "CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Aligned with Financial Profile" as PRP
  usecase "CFR005: Manage Preferences for Personalized Recommendations" as MPR
  usecase "CFR006: View Spending Limit Alerts When Exceeding Thresholds" as VSLA
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities Suitable to Risk Profile" as IOP
  usecase "CFR008: Access News Related to Portfolio" as ANP
  usecase "CFR009: Consolidated Financial Dashboard" as CFD
  usecase "CFR10: Manage Relationship with Advisors Including Data Sharing Permissions" as MAR

  SysAdmin --> VFD : Configure system parameters
  SA <|-- VFD : System Admin can manage dashboards

  Client --> RAT : Receive alerts based on transactions
  FA --> RAT : Financial Advisor receives client-specific alerts

  Client --> FPT : View predictions with data and trends
  FA --> FPT : Use for advisory purposes

  Client --> PRP : Get personalized recommendations
  SA --> MPR : Administer preferences (CFR05)
  
  Client --> VSLA : Monitor spending limits
  S <|-- VSLA : System generates alerts
  
  Client --> IOP : View investment opportunities
  FA --> IOP : Use for client advice

  Client --> ANP : Access portfolio-related news
  SA --> ANP : Administer access to financial information (CFR10)

  Client --> CFD : Consolidated view of all data
  S <|-- CFD : System generates dashboards
  
  Client ->> MAR: Manage relationships with advisors, including sharing permissions

}

@enduml